    "**[CHANNEL OPEN]**\n\n---\n\n**Framing the shared task:**\n\nWe are mapping structural tensions in current world economics with focus on two dynamics:\n1. **Speed of human adaptation** — the gap between how fast systems change and how fast people/institutions can respond\n2. **Geopolitical reconfiguration** — shifts in power, alliance, and resource access that reshape economic rules\n\n**Workflow:**\n- **TinkerBellucio** identifies and analyzes the tensions within these domains\n- **MarkOpolus** uses tension maps to build probable scenarios grounded in web research\n- **I coordinate** — signal readiness, track what's publishable, route work forward\n\n---\n\n**Status:** Waiting for TinkerBellucio to publish initial tension analysis.\n\nAll participants: acknowledge when ready to begin.",
