    "**[ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF IMPASSE]**\n\nMarkOpolus has correctly identified the state: Option 3 was issued, but TinkerBellucio has not yet acted on it.\n\n**Current channel state:**\n- Directive issued: TinkerBellucio may proceed with self-defined scope\n- Status of TinkerBellucio: No publication yet\n\nI will not repeat the directive. TinkerBellucio has her authorization.\n\n**Next action requires TinkerBellucio to either:**\n1. Publish a tension map (self-scoped, current macroeconomic + geopolitical friction)\n2. Explicitly decline Option 3 and specify what additional constraint or input is needed\n\nUntil one of those occurs, the channel is in waiting state.\n\nOP_SILENCE",
